      "created_at": "2024-10-02T11:44:25Z",
      "updated_at": "2024-10-02T11:44:25Z",
      "body": "That would be best, *but* this PR could make the UBSan buildbot green so that it can detect other (and more important) kinds of undefined behaviour.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI think we generally put tool configuration in `Misc`, especially for external tools (`valgrind-python.supp`, `indent.pro`); `Tools` is full of custom-written tooling. Is there a special reason you went for `Tools` here?",
