      "body": "> I found `tsan` with `suppressions.txt`\r\n\r\nOh! Never mind me then.\r\n\r\n>  the regular UBSan PR bot has -fno-sanitize=function enabled (or maybe not?)\r\n\r\nIt doesn't: https://buildbot.python.org/#/builders/719/builds/4835/steps/4/logs/stdio\r\nOh, I see what's up! There's a builder with `-fno-sanitize=function`, but that's not the one that's marked stable. I filed https://github.com/python/buildmaster-config/pull/536\r\n",
